# The game slug from your Bloxity developer dashboard.
# Copy this file to `.env` (or `.env.local`). Without it, builds use `floppy-front`.
# Register Floppy Front as its own game on Boxity first: the old template slug
# (1-phone-drop) belongs to Phone Plunge.
VITE_GAME_SLUG=floppy-front

# Bloxity environment (api / play / portal / static URLs): NOT configured here.
# The page that hosts the game sets window.BLOXITY_ENV and the SDK reads it; with none,
# production. To develop against a local Boxity stack instead:
#   BLOXITY_DEV_ENV=local npm run dev
# (a shell variable, not a VITE_ one - it only affects the dev server, never a build).

# Phase 1 (battle sandbox) runs entirely in the browser: no game server is used yet.
